<diagram name="04_Event_Approval_Clarified" id="ddc32e9f64d54cdc">
    <mxGraphModel dx="715" dy="855" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="850" pageHeight="1100" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&quot;data&quot;: &quot;\nsequenceDiagram\n    autonumber\n\n    actor CM as Club Manager\n    participant EV as Event Form (View)\n    participant EC as EventController\n    participant EM as EventModel\n    participant DB as Database\n    participant AC as ApprovalController\n    participant AV as Admin Review (View)\n    actor A as Admin\n\n    CM-&gt;&gt;EV: Enter event details and click Create\n    EV-&gt;&gt;EC: createEvent(eventData)\n    activate EC\n\n    Note over EC: Get manager ID and role from session\n\n    EC-&gt;&gt;EM: validateEventDetails(eventData)\n    activate EM\n    EM--&gt;&gt;EC: Validation result\n    deactivate EM\n\n    alt Valid details and authorized manager\n        EC-&gt;&gt;EM: createPendingEvent(managerId, eventData)\n        activate EM\n        EM-&gt;&gt;DB: Insert event with Pending Approval status\n        activate DB\n        DB--&gt;&gt;EM: Event saved with eventId\n        deactivate DB\n        EM--&gt;&gt;EC: Event created successfully\n        deactivate EM\n\n        EC--&gt;&gt;EV: Return pending confirmation\n        EV--&gt;&gt;CM: Display Pending Approval\n    else Invalid details or unauthorized manager\n        EC--&gt;&gt;EV: Return validation or access error\n        EV--&gt;&gt;CM: Display error message\n    end\n\n    deactivate EC\n\n    Note over A,AV: Later - Admin role is checked before pending events are listed\n\n    A-&gt;&gt;AV: Open pending events list\n    AV-&gt;&gt;AC: getPendingEvents()\n    activate AC\n\n    AC-&gt;&gt;EM: fetchPendingEvents()\n    activate EM\n    EM-&gt;&gt;DB: Query pending events\n    activate DB\n    DB--&gt;&gt;EM: Pending events\n    deactivate DB\n    EM--&gt;&gt;AC: Pending events list\n    deactivate EM\n\n    AC--&gt;&gt;AV: Display pending events\n    AV--&gt;&gt;A: Show events awaiting review\n    deactivate AC\n\n    A-&gt;&gt;AV: Select event and choose decision\n    AV-&gt;&gt;AC: reviewEvent(eventId, decision)\n    activate AC\n\n    Note over AC: Recheck Admin role before saving decision\n\n    alt Authorized Admin\n        AC-&gt;&gt;EM: updateApprovalStatus(eventId, decision)\n        activate EM\n        EM-&gt;&gt;DB: Update status only if still Pending\n        activate DB\n        DB--&gt;&gt;EM: Update result\n        deactivate DB\n        EM--&gt;&gt;AC: Review result\n        deactivate EM\n\n        alt Decision is Approve and update succeeds\n            AC--&gt;&gt;AV: Event Approved\n            AV--&gt;&gt;A: Display approval confirmation\n            Note over EM,DB: Approved event becomes visible and triggers Sequence 6 notifications\n        else Decision is Reject and update succeeds\n            AC--&gt;&gt;AV: Event Rejected\n            AV--&gt;&gt;A: Display rejection confirmation\n        else Event no longer Pending\n            AC--&gt;&gt;AV: Review failed\n            AV--&gt;&gt;A: Display status conflict\n        end\n    else Unauthorized user\n        AC--&gt;&gt;AV: Access denied\n        AV--&gt;&gt;A: Display permission error\n    end\n\n    deactivate AC\n&quot;, &quot;config&quot;: null, &quot;version&quot;: &quot;12&quot;}" id="oW-CiLCDWRrnG51zjrZo-69">
          <mxCell connectable="0" parent="1" style="group;transparentBounds=1;editIcon=1;lockedGroup=0;groupPadding=10;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
