<diagram name="05_Budget_and_Expenses" id="870322dffc2c428f">
    <mxGraphModel dx="715" dy="855" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="850" pageHeight="1100" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#10;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;\nsequenceDiagram\n    autonumber\n\n    actor A as Admin\n    actor CM as Club Manager\n    participant V as Finance Dashboard (View)\n    participant C as FinanceController\n    participant BM as BudgetModel\n    participant EM as ExpenseModel\n    participant DB as Database\n\n    Note over A,DB: Part 1 - Admin allocates club budget\n\n    A-&gt;&gt;V: Select club and enter budget amount\n    V-&gt;&gt;C: allocateBudget(clubId, amount)\n    activate C\n\n    Note over C: Verify Admin role from session\n\n    alt Authorized Admin and valid amount\n        C-&gt;&gt;BM: allocateBudget(clubId, amount)\n        activate BM\n\n        BM-&gt;&gt;DB: Save budget allocation\n        activate DB\n        DB--&gt;&gt;BM: Budget saved\n        deactivate DB\n\n        BM--&gt;&gt;C: Allocation successful\n        deactivate BM\n\n        C--&gt;&gt;V: Return success\n        V--&gt;&gt;A: Display Budget Allocated\n\n    else Unauthorized or invalid amount\n        C--&gt;&gt;V: Return error\n        V--&gt;&gt;A: Display allocation error\n    end\n\n    deactivate C\n\n    Note over CM,DB: Part 2 - Club Manager records an expense\n\n    CM-&gt;&gt;V: Enter expense amount and description\n    V-&gt;&gt;C: recordExpense(clubId, amount, description)\n    activate C\n\n    Note over C: Verify manager is assigned to club\n\n    alt Authorized manager and valid expense\n        C-&gt;&gt;EM: validateAndRecordExpense(clubId, amount, description)\n        activate EM\n\n        EM-&gt;&gt;DB: Read current club budget\n        activate DB\n        DB--&gt;&gt;EM: Remaining balance\n        deactivate DB\n\n        alt Sufficient budget\n            EM-&gt;&gt;DB: Atomically save expense and reduce balance\n            activate DB\n            DB--&gt;&gt;EM: Expense saved and new balance\n            deactivate DB\n\n            EM--&gt;&gt;C: Expense recorded and remaining balance\n            C--&gt;&gt;V: Return updated budget\n            V--&gt;&gt;CM: Display success and remaining balance\n\n        else Insufficient budget\n            EM--&gt;&gt;C: Expense rejected - insufficient funds\n            C--&gt;&gt;V: Return insufficient budget error\n            V--&gt;&gt;CM: Display error message\n        end\n\n        deactivate EM\n\n    else Unauthorized or invalid expense\n        C--&gt;&gt;V: Return validation or access error\n        V--&gt;&gt;CM: Display error message\n    end\n\n    deactivate C\n\n&quot;,&#10;  &quot;config&quot;: null,&#10;  &quot;version&quot;: &quot;12&quot;&#10;}" id="oW-CiLCDWRrnG51zjrZo-174">
          <mxCell connectable="0" parent="1" style="group;transparentBounds=1;editIcon=1;lockedGroup=0;groupPadding=10;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
