<diagram name="06_Subscription_Notifications" id="89e36168ddf64587">
    <mxGraphModel dx="715" dy="855" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="850" pageHeight="1100" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#10;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;\nsequenceDiagram\n    autonumber\n\n    actor S as Student\n    participant V as Student Portal (View)\n    participant C as StudentController\n    participant SM as SubscriptionModel\n    participant AC as ApprovalController\n    participant NM as NotificationModel\n    participant DB as Database\n\n    Note over S,DB: Part 1 - Student subscribes to a club\n\n    S-&gt;&gt;V: Open club page and click Subscribe\n    V-&gt;&gt;C: subscribeToClub(clubId)\n    activate C\n\n    Note over C: Get studentId from authenticated session\n\n    C-&gt;&gt;SM: subscribe(studentId, clubId)\n    activate SM\n\n    SM-&gt;&gt;DB: Check club and insert subscription if absent\n    activate DB\n    DB--&gt;&gt;SM: Subscription result\n    deactivate DB\n\n    alt Subscription successful\n        SM--&gt;&gt;C: Subscription confirmed\n        C--&gt;&gt;V: Return success\n        V--&gt;&gt;S: Display Subscribed Successfully\n\n    else Student already subscribed\n        SM--&gt;&gt;C: Duplicate subscription\n        C--&gt;&gt;V: Return already subscribed message\n        V--&gt;&gt;S: Display Already Subscribed\n\n    else Club not found\n        SM--&gt;&gt;C: Invalid club\n        C--&gt;&gt;V: Return club not found error\n        V--&gt;&gt;S: Display Error Message\n    end\n\n    deactivate SM\n    deactivate C\n\n    Note over S,DB: Part 2 - New approved event generates notifications\n\n    Note over AC,DB: Triggered after Admin approves event in Sequence 4\n\n    AC-&gt;&gt;NM: notifyClubSubscribers(clubId, eventId)\n    activate NM\n\n    NM-&gt;&gt;DB: Get subscribers of this club\n    activate DB\n    DB--&gt;&gt;NM: Subscriber list\n    deactivate DB\n\n    loop For each subscribed student\n        NM-&gt;&gt;DB: Save event notification\n        activate DB\n        DB--&gt;&gt;NM: Notification saved\n        deactivate DB\n    end\n\n    NM--&gt;&gt;AC: Notification process completed\n    deactivate NM\n\n    Note over S,DB: Part 3 - Student views notifications\n\n    S-&gt;&gt;V: Open Notifications\n    V-&gt;&gt;C: getMyNotifications()\n    activate C\n\n    Note over C: Get studentId from session\n\n    C-&gt;&gt;NM: fetchNotifications(studentId)\n    activate NM\n\n    NM-&gt;&gt;DB: Read student notifications\n    activate DB\n    DB--&gt;&gt;NM: Notification list\n    deactivate DB\n\n    NM--&gt;&gt;C: Notifications\n    deactivate NM\n\n    alt Notifications available\n        C--&gt;&gt;V: Return notification list\n        V--&gt;&gt;S: Display Notifications\n\n    else No notifications\n        C--&gt;&gt;V: Return empty list\n        V--&gt;&gt;S: Display No Notifications\n    end\n\n    deactivate C\n&quot;,&#10;  &quot;config&quot;: null,&#10;  &quot;version&quot;: &quot;12&quot;&#10;}" id="oW-CiLCDWRrnG51zjrZo-255">
          <mxCell connectable="0" parent="1" style="group;transparentBounds=1;editIcon=1;lockedGroup=0;groupPadding=10;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
